# "Target creature": Pym Particles may target an opponent's creature, and Bot1 still draws. It is a sorcery: on Bot2's turn it cannot be cast
# (the refusal, Bot1 has an untapped Island), on Bot1's own main phase the same cast is offered (the positive control).

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Island
Ornithopter
Pym Particles
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Pass
! Bot1.Hand.Pym Particles.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
? Bot1.Library.Count = 12
Bot1.Hand.Pym Particles.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Library.Count = 11
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Keywords = Flying; Vigilance
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.CantBeBlocked = true

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Pym Particles
